Dear {!Contact.FirstName}, <br />
<p>
In order to gain access to Salesforce, you will need to complete two training courses: 1.) FERPA and 2.) Salesforce: Recruitment Training. They can be found on the UTO Training website by clicking  <a href="https://sites.google.com/a/asu.edu/utotraining/" target="_blank">UTO Training</a> or by searching Blackboard on  <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/myasu/" target="_blank">My ASU</a>. Let me know if you have any difficulty finding the training courses. </p>
<p>
Once your training is complete, you will request the Salesforce Recruiting role. Instructions how to do this can be found at the following article: <a href="https://asu.service-now.com/ess/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0012611" target="_blank">How to Request Access to Salesforce</a>. Please let me know if you have any further questions about this request.
</p>
Sincerely, <br />
 {!User.Name}<br /><br />


<b>ASU Salesforce Support</b><br />
USB | University Technology Office<br />
1551 S. Rural Rd.<br />
Tempe, AZ 85281<br />
